Bhai simple rule hai —

---

## Pehle question padho aur yeh dekho:

**"One by one", "one after another", "first...then"** likha hai?
→ **Multiplication** (order matter karta hai)

**Sirf "2 balls drawn", "selected"** likha hai?
→ **Combination** (order matter nahi)

---

## Lekin actually —

> **Dono se same answer aata hai!**

Toh confuse mat ho — jo samajh aaye woh karo 😄

---

## Tera notes wala example:

| Question | Method |
|---|---|
| Q1 — "2 balls drawn, same color" | Combination easy hai |
| Q2 — "1R + 1B" | Combination ya Multiplication dono |
| Q3 — "one by one with replacement" | **Sirf Multiplication** |
| Q6 — "one after another" | Multiplication |

---

## Ek line mein:

> **WITH replacement** → hamesha Multiplication
>
> **WITHOUT replacement** → dono chalte hain, jo easy lage

Kal paper mein time kam ho toh **Multiplication** karo — fast hota hai! 😊
